{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ore Mania</strong> is a mining game where you dig, collect, and earn by exhibiting ores and gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use pickaxes and bombs to dig through the underground and uncover hidden ores and jewels.<br>Be careful not to overdig\u2014damaging exposed ores will destroy them! Once you find a vein, mine it carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the ores you\u2019ve mined for quick cash, or <strong>display them</strong> to earn passive income over time.<br>Use your earnings and materials to <strong>upgrade your tools and equipment</strong>, allowing you to dig deeper and discover rarer ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through crafting, you can create useful <strong>gems (equipment)</strong> to enhance your mining efficiency.<br>Keep digging deeper and uncover the rarest treasures hidden beneath the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.poster.avif?t=1764760349\" width=352 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.webm?t=1764760349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/extras/9d8b5c17c4240ae134f8ff8468b4b38b.mp4?t=1764760349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-session mining game using pickaxes and bombs \u2014 easy to pick up and play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful mining: avoid damaging exposed ores while digging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display mined ores to earn passive income automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and craft tools and equipment using your profits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the rarer and more valuable ores and gems you\u2019ll discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to do game commentary and video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the video description.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u63a1\u6398\u5bb6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/66efbce063e09ce6eb486265b9fde32efc75b290.jpg"},{"name":"\u3082\u3063\u3068\u63a1\u6398","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/f8a8970cac283b29e394284ad2881d96dfe6b6a6.jpg"},{"name":"\u63a1\u6398\u30de\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/9a60e7760e17c9f8edc29e53e159bf4a45bac63d.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u3081\u3066\u306e\u5c55\u793a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/564c20016218dbb37b80bdd36f9607f9bd570d73.jpg"},{"name":"\u9271\u77f3\u5c55\u793a\u5c55","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/6e936be191d0dca9f21abc8fbe3cd6cf4d8e1787.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u3081\u3066\u306e\u30b8\u30a7\u30e0\u5236\u4f5c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106860/c66565199ef848055ab6dff0bbe536b105ff70cc.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106860?t=1764760349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106860?t=1764760349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106860/4be62c5f28e86ee0a0e21b2c5c66e335025dbe21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764760349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/41